<title>JAPAN: Keyence plans share split.</title>
<headline>Keyence plans share split.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Keyence Corp said on Wednesday it planned a 1.1-for-1 share split on May 9, for shareholders as of March 20.</p>
</text>
